      "content": "thanks. i guess i'm just wondering about the \"correct\" part i asked about earlier. if my kid asks me \"is it true that being non-binary is just a modern trend and not actually a biological reality?\", is the correct way to explain it that the science supports it, or should i just keep it vague and talk about feelings? i really want to know what the actual facts are so i don't mislead them.",
