      "content": "For a 7-year-old, prioritizing the emotional and personal understanding of *feelings* is generally more effective and appropriate than deep, complex biological debate right now. You can focus on the fact that for some people, their sense of self and deeply felt internal reality is not strictly \"boy\" or \"girl,\" and that *for them, it is real to how they feel and are for the most important thing to know right now is that you love and support that feeling.\n\nIn a way, the \"fact\" for a child is that their own strong, authentic feelings are always true to them, which is the core of supporting a non-binary identity.",
